00:08:54,000 --> 00:09:00,000
Sooner or later everyone does.

2
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:54,000
Meet Joe Black is a fantasy, drama, romance film directed by Martin Brest.

3
00:26:42,000 --> 00:26:48,000
Bill Parrish has it all - success, wealth and power.

4
00:35:36,000 --> 00:35:42,000
Days before his 65th birthday, he receives a visit from a mysterious
stranger, Joe Black, who soon reveals himself as Death.

5
00:44:30,000 --> 00:44:36,000
In exchange for extra time, Bill agrees to serve as Joe's earthly guide.

6
00:53:24,000 --> 00:53:30,000
But will he regret his choice when Joe unexpectedly falls in
love with Bill's beautiful daughter Susan?

7
01:02:18,000 --> 01:02:24,000
Joe Black / Young Man in Coffee Shop, played by Brad Pitt.

8
01:11:12,000 --> 01:11:18,000
William Parrish, played by Anthony Hopkins.

9
01:20:06,000 --> 01:20:12,000
Susan Parrish, played by Claire Forlani.

