Allison, played by Marcia Gay Harden.

12
01:46:48,000 --> 01:46:54,000
Quince, played by Jeffrey Tambor.

13
01:55:42,000 --> 01:55:48,000
Meet Joe Black is a 1998 American romantic fantasy drama film directed and produced by
Martin Brest, starring Brad Pitt, Anthony Hopkins, and Claire Forlani.

14
02:04:36,000 --> 02:04:42,000
The screenplay was written by Bo Goldman, Kevin Wade, Ron Osborn, and Jeff Reno, and is loosely based on the 1934 film Death Takes a Holiday, which is itself based on the 1929
play Death Takes a Holiday by Walter Ferris, which is in turn an English-language adaptation of the 1924 Italian play La morte in vacanza by Alberto Casella.

15
02:13:30,000 --> 02:13:36,000
Celebrating his 65th birthday, businessman and devoted family man Bill Parrish is visited by Death, who
wants to know what it is like to be human in return for giving Bill extra days of his life.

16
02:22:24,000 --> 02:22:30,000
Meet Joe Black premiered at the Tokyo International Film Festival on November 8,
1998 and was released by Universal Pictures on November 13, 1998.

17
02:31:18,000 --> 02:31:24,000
The film received mixed reviews from critics and grossed
$142.9 million against a $90 million budget.

18
02:40:12,000 --> 02:40:18,000
The film explores themes of life and death, broken engagement, love
at first sight, fireworks, religion and supernatural.

19
02:49:06,000 --> 02:49:12,000
The tone is emotional.
